OL,3,GNEWSANew mural 'keeps alive' 1960s
OL,4,Anightclub memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new mural has been unveiled to
OL,7,Fcelebrate a former Sheffield
OL,8,Fnightclub's place in Yorkshire's
OL,9,Fcultural landscape.
OL,11,FOpened by Peter Stringfellow and his
OL,12,Fbrother Geoff in 1964, the King Mojo
OL,13,Fclub hosted celebrities such as Tina
OL,14,FTurner, Stevie Wonder, Pink Floyd and
OL,15,FJimi Hendrix, before closing in 1967.
OL,17,FThe artwork was commissioned as part of
OL,18,Fa the Mojo Rising project to mark the
OL,19,Fclub's 60th anniversary, and celebrates
OL,20,Fsome of its most memorable moments.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
