OL,3,GNEWSANew mural 'keeps alive' 1960s
OL,4,Anightclub memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Angie Hardwick said the mural
OL,7,Fcelebrated "the music heritage of
OL,8,FSheffield", adding: "It's really
OL,9,Fimportant to show Sheffield now, what
OL,10,Fit was like then, that it was a vibrant
OL,11,Fcity."
